 "summary": "A bare quartz resonator, AT cut on its fundamental, made at any nominal frequency from 8 MHz to 54 MHz. The body is 5.0 mm by 3.2 mm and 1.2 mm tall, glass sealed, with two pads, one at each end. Standard load capacitance is 10 pF or 20 pF and standard tolerance at 25 °C is ±10 ppm or ±20 ppm; other values are made to order. Listed uses are industrial control and consumer electronics.",
